# Sitemap & Route Inventory

## 1. Information Architecture & Route Inventory

| Route | Page Name | Primary Nav? | Rendering Strategy | Dynamic Params |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/` | Home | Yes | Static (SSG) | None |
| `/about` | About & Credentials | Yes | Static (SSG) | None |
| `/projects` | Projects Showcase | Yes | Static (SSG) | None |
| `/projects/[slug]` | Case Study Detail | No | SSG + ISR | `slug` |
| `/lab` | Interactive Lab | Yes | Client Hydrated | None |
| `/contact` | Contact & Inquiries | Yes | Static (SSG) | None |
| `/api/health` | Health Check | No | Dynamic (`force-dynamic`) | None |

---

## 2. Page & Section Hierarchy Breakdown

### Home (`/`)
- **Global Header**: Brand emblem, navigation menu, locale switcher, theme toggle.
- **Hero Section**: Value proposition headline, status indicator badge, primary action CTAs.
- **Featured Projects**: Responsive case study card grid with metrics and tag pills.
- **Interactive Lab Preview**: Live diagnostic tool card launchers.
- **Trust Signals**: ORCID credentials, verification tokens, publications list.
- **Global Footer**: Site index links, copyright, system status.

---

## 3. Rendering & Hydration Matrix
- **Static Pre-rendering (SSG)**: Home, About, Projects list, Contact.
- **Dynamic / Incremental Regeneration (ISR)**: Project detail articles.
- **Client Components (`"use client"`)**: Interactive lab probers, theme switcher, mobile drawer navigation, contact form.

